  "sentences": [
    {"text": "A pale, rosy dawn crept over the horizon, rinsing the stars from the sky.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "The first, tentative rays of sunlight gilded the rooftops one by one.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "It was a cool, dewy morning, and tiny drops sparkled on every blade of grass.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "Birds stirred in the hedgerows, and soon a jubilant dawn chorus filled the lane.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "Crisp, clear daylight flooded the valley and sharpened every edge.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A brilliant, cloudless sky stretched overhead, blue from rim to rim.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "The sun climbed steadily higher, and the long, slanting shadows of early morning shrank back towards the walls.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "By noon a harsh, blinding glare beat down on the square, bleaching the colour from everything.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "The fierce midday sun scorched the back of his neck.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "A shimmering heat haze hung over the fields, and the far hedges wavered like reflections.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "The drowsy, golden afternoon bathed the garden in warmth, and even the bees seemed to fly more slowly.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "Warm shafts of sunlight slanted through the window and lay across the floorboards.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "The day dawned grey and cold, a dull, overcast morning with no promise in it.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "A sullen, leaden sky pressed down on the town like a lid.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "Dazzling shards of light glinted on the water.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "In the sultry, airless noon, nothing moved but the flies.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Sunlight streamed through the leaves and dappled the path.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Shadows lengthened across the lawn in the mellow, late-afternoon light.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "By nine the sun had burned away the mist, and the hills stood out sharp and green.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "The street woke all at once: shutters banged, a radio blared, and children spilled onto the pavement.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "Sunshine poured over the market, and every stall seemed to shout its colours.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "The sun blazed down without mercy, and the tar on the road began to melt.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "A hot, dry wind sprang up at noon and flung dust in their faces.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "The white, empty sky of midday offered no shade and no company.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "He watched the daylight drain from the room, hour by hour, and nobody came.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "Even in broad daylight, the house seemed to hold on to its shadows.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "Morning light poured like honey over the hills.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "The clouds parted, and a single beam pierced the gloom.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "She sat on the step with her face turned to the sun, eyes closed, perfectly content.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "The afternoon wore on, hot and slow.", "vibe": "General"}
  ]
